    "Storm Rider schedules Shadow Nova at 7 seconds and every 8 seconds locally; Time Warden schedules Fireball Barrage locally at 13 seconds and every 31 seconds; Whelps schedule Scorching Breath at 13 or 24 seconds and every 31 seconds.",
    "Below 50 percent Halfus schedules a three-cast Furious Roar sequence; the local internal timing differs from current strategy approximations.",
    "The local boss schedules Berserk at 10 minutes while current strategy sources report a 6-minute enrage."
